## YYYY-MM-DD (backfilled): Extra programs break the desktop
- Added Zenity, PCManFM, Dillo, Badwolf. Each led to stripes or a black screen
  with a flickering pink right edge. ✅
- Causes (Xwayland, EGL access, `libelogind` replacing `libseat`) are ⚠️, not isolated.
- Rolled back to the clean rootfs backup, disabled Xwayland, removed the
  browser and file manager.
- SD card FAT32 error after a 1 GB `adb push` ("clusters badly computed"),
  fixed with `fsck_msdos`. Lesson: `sync` and check the card.
- Wallpaper launcher did not start: Weston passes the launcher path as one
  string. Fixed with a wrapper script.

